  "markdown_content": "## Cast Update\\nShah Rukh Khan's upcoming film \"King\" has been generating significant buzz since its initial announcement last year. The project gains additional attention as it's directed by Siddharth Anand, who helmed Khan's comeback film \"Pathaan\", and marks the theatrical debut of Shah Rukh's daughter Suhana Khan following her OTT debut in \"The Archies\".\\n\\n## New Addition\\nAccording to a report by Peeping Moon, Arshad Warsi has joined the film's cast in a pivotal role, though specific details about his character are currently confidential. While Shah Rukh Khan and Warsi have maintained a long-standing friendship, this marks their first substantial collaboration in a film together, aside from Khan's previous guest appearance in Warsi's 2005 film \"Kuchh Meetha Ho Jayein\".\\n\\n## Production Details\\nThe film is being produced under Khan's Red Chillies Entertainment and Siddharth Anand's Marflix Pictures. The cast also includes notable actors:\\n* Abhishek Bachchan\\n* Abhay Verma of \"Munjya\" fame",
